This server runs KubeSolo and the components, for one person. On your own computer:

  ssh <you>@203.0.113.10 sudo cat /etc/zeabur-installer/kubeconfig.yaml > ~/.kube/vps-1.yaml
  KUBECONFIG=~/.kube/vps-1.yaml zeaburctl ui --context vps-1

Whoever has this file is cluster admin; keep it like an SSH key. If your computer reaches the server at another address, change `server:` in the file and add the address to host.tlsSan.
